> The VGA cable plugged: Recognized the display-> test fail.
>
>
> Disabled CMA: The same to the case of enabled CMA.
>
> I attach the test procedures and test tool, test result.
> Please have a look at it.
>
> Thank you very much.
>
> Jinso Linux team
> Dong
